# IST/snapshot investigation tooling (one-off; superseded by
# committed rebuild_account_snapshots.py / reconcile_snapshots.py)
#
# `apply_sql_migration.py` and `run_snapshot_traced.py` were removed from this
# list: neither is a one-off and neither is superseded. The first is the runner the
# migration procedure documents, the second is the artefact .planning/USER-ASK.md
# cites as the evidence for A2. A block written for investigations had swept up two
# durable tools, which is how a documented command becomes unreviewable.
